Package: nzplannedcare
Title: NZ Planned Care Explorer Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Reads Health NZ elective services patient flow indicator (ESPI)
    data, checks it, models trends and builds the data for a static website.
    Not an installable package; this file lists dependencies for CI.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    jsonlite,
    lubridate,
    MASS,
    mgcv,
    readr,
    readxl,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
